abstract: >-
  Research code for Three-star Global Macro Association analysis, combining
  country-mean correlations, adjusted correlations and quantitative temporal
  models. Includes eligibility reconstruction, multiplicity-controlled grading,
  sensitivity analyses, simulations and numerical verification.
